  "description": "The GoLine Pro Foldable Electric Scooter is built for faster commutes, short-distance travel, and everyday urban riding. Powered by a 350W brushless motor, it reaches speeds of up to 20 mph and offers a riding range of up to 18 miles per charge. Its 36V lithium battery fully recharges in approximately five to six hours, providing dependable performance for daily trips.\nConstructed with a durable aluminum-alloy frame, the GoLine Pro folds into a compact size for convenient storage and transport. It features four speed levels, 10-inch solid tires, a responsive disc brake, an LED display, integrated turn signals, front and rear lights, and an integrated horn. Front and rear fenders, a kickstand, and IPX4 water resistance provide added convenience and protection for a practical and comfortable riding experience.\n.\n\n20mphTop Speed\n\nUp to 18 miles Range\n\n350 W Hub Motor\n\n36V7.8 Ah",
